# vision_streaming: ffmpeg watchdog with hung-alive and degraded-stream detection. The capture node
#   resolves the camera by sysfs index, so a /dev/videoN shift is normal and handled.
#   NEVER key a camera by /dev/videoN - use usbcam-<vidpid>-<serial>-i<iface>.
#   vision_streaming RUNNING IS NOT STREAMING. Prove it: pgrep -af "[f]ffmpeg" should show the
#   encoder at ~110% CPU and ss -unap should show wfb-server bound on 5602. Do NOT use
#   /proc/<pid>/io wchar - RTP goes out via sendto, which does not increment it.
# LG Smart Cam is the current FPV camera; both cameras are FPV-capable on port 6-2. SWAP FROM QGC
#   ONLY. FPV video costs /scan 28.4 -> 22.3 Hz. Do NOT modify the ffmpeg line (vetoed).
